This project does not bundle third-party source code. It depends on external
libraries that are resolved by Gradle at build time and keep their own licenses:

* AndroidX Core, Activity, Lifecycle, Compose (Material 3, Wear Compose),
  DataStore and Navigation 3 - Apache 2.0
  https://developer.android.com/jetpack
* AndroidX Media3 (ExoPlayer, Common, Session) - Apache 2.0
  https://github.com/androidx/media
* Kotlin standard library, kotlinx.coroutines and kotlinx.serialization - Apache 2.0
  https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin
* JUnit 4 - EPL 1.0 / GPL 2.0 with Classpath Exception (test dependency only)
* Google Play services for Wear OS - Google Terms of Service
  https://developers.google.com/android/guides/terms

Album cover lookup uses the public MusicBrainz/Cover Art Archive and iTunes
Search APIs. Only track title, artist and album are sent; no third-party code
from those services is included in this repository.
